## 🔄 WORKFLOW DE DEPLOY

### **GitHub Actions**
```yaml
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml
name: Deploy
on:
  push:
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  deploy-render:
    # Testa no Render primeiro
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      - name: Deploy to Render
        # Script para deploy Render

  deploy-aws:
    needs: deploy-render
    # Deploy para AWS apenas após sucesso no Render
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name: Deploy to AWS ECS
        # Script para deploy AWS
```

